    "Replaced the Amazon runtime adapter with optional Azure locked-WORM and permanent safety storage",
    "Implemented independent namespace retirement, recovery and lost-consumption-acknowledgement handling",
    "Encrypted backups authenticate before empty-target restore; migrations verify checksums and refuse downgrade",
    "Added TLS receiver persistence, event cursor handling, quota invariants and expired delivery refusal",
    "Clerk-compatible metadata and Basic authentication tested with correct form-decoding in the isolated provider",
    "Reviewer removal clears assignment without resetting proposal limits; unrelated membership additions preserve grants",
    "Added public HTTP conformance fixtures, response schema checks, rotation boundary cases and operational metrics",
    "Restricted the no-Amazon dependency check to production; unused SES typings remain development-only",
    "Fixed the published choice App schema mismatch and kept native form submission forbidden by the sandbox",
    "Packaged independent contracts, verified CLI entry point and embedded App licence notices",
    "Counter execution window now includes launch durability and initial reads; admission is rechecked at the protected counter update",
    "Fixed counter verifies context, format and policy before claim and refuses invalid numeric state",
    "Separation of duties compares verified OIDC identities as well as directory identifiers",
    "SDK refuses unknown required profiles and mismatched execution provenance",
    "Daily quota counters survive audit cleanup and credential rotation; migration conservatively pauses creation for the UTC day",
    "Added actual database-lock timing, exact SDK deadline, OIDC callback and anchoring-I/O expiry regressions",
    "Historical public trust keys for permanent safety records are retained indefinitely",
    "Preserved full transitive browser notices for Zod and zod-to-json-schema",
    "CI clears historical outputs before validation to prevent stale artefact uploads"
  ],
  "remaining_gates": [
